    "updated_at": "2026-11-21T16:25:47Z",
    "body": "A new synthetic reference work imported on an offline copy of the Classic Cut 2S control. The reopened work showed 10 mm steel, 0.25 mm Berco wire and zero working steps. Its work-specific dialog displayed the requested quality tuple.\n\nThe technology search proposed a different four-step process with a coarser finish. The requested work itself had no assigned pass offset. This test does not qualify an erosion recipe.\n\nThe implementation now in work is an explicit nominal setup inspection export. It preserves the selected sketch curves and the requested internal start. It must report zero working steps and unverified holding, leads and working technology. The ordinary cutting post keeps its existing refusals. The native CAMCraft files still need their own control check.\n",
