    "body": "fix on issue/3179-agie-10mm-opening · PR #3219 · pinned by saved_selected_opening_exports_zero_steps_through_the_desktop_action, agie_inspection_accepts_listed_chain_and_checks_mounted_travel_in_the_wcs, and setup_post_inspection_fields_and_submit_fit_the_visible_panel · merges at the next cut.\n\nThis is the zero-step inspection part of the issue. The work-level check refused undefined working technology. The whole-piece check also refused the unknown zero planar dimensions. The ordinary cutting post keeps its safety checks. Physical holding and erosion technology remain open.\n\nAll eight scoped tests and strict all-target Clippy passed on the published head. The reached heavy gate is queued. Please mirror the contributor state to in-review for this partial draft.\n",
